(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF MICRO, SMALL AND MEDIUM ENTERPRISES) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: MSME INNOVATIVE SCHEME \(INCUBATION, DESIGN AND IPR\) \(MSME-INNOVATIVE\) / MSME DEVELOPMENT AND FACILITATION OFFICES \(MSME-DFO\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Fosters innovation, commercialization of ideas, design thinking, and) Tj
T*
(intellectual property development among MSMEs and tech startups.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. Registered MSMEs with valid Udyam Registration.) Tj
T*
(2. Students, innovators, and start-ups associated with recognized Host) Tj
T*
(   Institutes \(IITs, NITs, engineering colleges\).) Tj
T*
(3. Focus on developing novel proof of concepts and patentable technologies.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Financial support up to Rs. 15 Lakh per approved idea for incubation; up to) Tj
T*
(   Rs. 40 Lakh for design projects; up to Rs. 5 Lakh for foreign patent) Tj
T*
(   registration.) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 100.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 15.0 Lakh per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Udyam Certificate) Tj
T*
(2. Detailed Innovation Pitch & Concept Note) Tj
T*
(3. Host Institute Recommendation Letter) Tj
T*
(4. Patent / Trademark Search Report) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online via MSME Innovative Portal) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://champions.gov.in/msme_champions/MSME_Innovative.htm) Tj
T*
